 "2184872072072152", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_2184872075405485_4008272742366392584_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EnAouz6sndMQ7kNvwFRk7IY&_nc_oc=AdqqADMmvVX_76wg2eGTLoY36oJOeYoydCHNmBphN7Q951BKCuwIE4v4cwH327NksGI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSc2N21gHQbezD5XOeivbM4FLVUR62hfNpHF0nR2m2T2w&oe=6AECAD93"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punchable Face", "keywords": ["boxing", "punching", "arcade", "stress", "fitness"], "long_description": "Sometimes you just want to punch a face.\n\n**Punchable Face** is a simple VR stress toy built around one idea: choose an irritating character, step into their world, and go to town.\n\n## Choose Your Face\n\n### The Barker\nA grinning carnival loudmouth waiting for you under the lights.\n\n### The Flexer\nA smug car-meet regular surrounded by modified cars and nighttime parking-lot lights.\n\n## Hit Harder\n\nEvery valid punch is measured using your controller speed and converted into an **Impact Score from 100 to 999**.\n\nChase your Session Best and watch each character react with movement, haptics, impact audio, facial reactions, and accumulating redness that slowly fades when you stop.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two characters with unique environments\n- Physics-based punch detection\n- Impact Score and Session Best\n- Hand-specific haptics\n- Reactive faces and visual feedback\n- Standing or seated play\n- No locomotion, rounds, health bars, or complicated progression\n\n**Pick a face. Punch it.**", "short_description": "Pick an annoying face, put on your gloves, and start swinging. Punchable Face is a simple VR stress toy with satisfying impacts, haptics, scoring, and two ridiculous characters to pummel."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/privacy-policy/punchable-face", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StormXR LLC", "s